# Support — Eye Control Yes No

For support, questions, or feedback, please contact:

[eyecontrol.yesno@gmail.com](mailto:eyecontrol.yesno@gmail.com)

Eye Control Yes No is a simple and accessible communication aid that helps users express choices using large visual cards.

The app allows users to answer Yes, No, or Maybe using different selection methods, depending on their needs and abilities:

* eye gaze;
* touch;
* swipe gestures.

The app also allows users to create custom communication themes with 2 or 3 cards. Each card can be personalised with text, colours, emojis or photos.

Custom themes can be imported and exported, making it easier to share communication cards with family members, carers, healthcare professionals, educators or support workers.

If you need help using the app, creating custom themes, importing or exporting themes, or understanding the available accessibility options, please contact us by email.
